=== ch0_dawn ===
The dawn touches the meadow, and thirty small creatures sleep on in the grass.
-> END

=== ch0_pim_wakes ===
Pim wakes, and pats the grass beside it, as if someone ought to be there.
Pim: "Want half? I have a whole one!"
-> END

=== ch0_pim_looks_up ===
Then Pim looks straight up, past the tree and the light, at you.
-> END
